base client for integrations

For the interop API, we have a `createTRPCClient` that works like this:
```ts
const client = createTRPCClient<AppRouter>()

const post = client.query('post.byId', { id: 0 });
```

This was good for interop routers but those are all deprecated now. But we still access these methods for proxy stuff under the hood:
https://github.com/trpc/trpc/blob/c5b49adb1d4e875633bb88ce282a3573fa00b404/packages/client/src/createTRPCClientProxy.ts#L121-L127

The `const client = new TRPCClient` is an fully-typed interop client so none of our new proxy types work correctly when accessing it so we cast to `any` when using it:
https://github.com/trpc/trpc/blob/c5b49adb1d4e875633bb88ce282a3573fa00b404/packages/client/src/createTRPCClientProxy.ts#L115-L116

For both third-party clients and our own clients we should improve to be more type-safe. For example `jotai-trpc` could have benefited from a more basic client that was loose on type safety: https://github.com/jotai-labs/jotai-trpc/pull/1#discussion_r955662034.

So we're looking for something like this:
```ts
import { createBaseClient } from '@trpc/server'

const client = createBaseClient({
  links: [/* ... */]
})

// client's APIs are not strictly typed

const post = client.query('post.byId', { id: 0 })
//    ^? `any`
```

`client.query` accepts a `string` (as opposed to a union of all the router's paths) and accepts an input object - `unknown`. It returns an object of `any`. All methods should be supported - query, mutation, subscription. This basic API will allow us to use it to easily build other integrations on top of without explicitly casting to `any` everywhere. You can use [the current `TRPCClient` for inspiration](https://github.com/trpc/trpc/blob/c5b49adb1d4e875633bb88ce282a3573fa00b404/packages/client/src/internals/TRPCClient.ts#L56).

feat: Split `GetInferenceHelpers` in `Output` and `Input`

### Describe the feature you'd like to request

Instead of having inference helpers that expose input and output together, I think we should make _two_ distinct inference helpers

Current:

```tsx
type RouterTypes = GetInferenceHelpers<AppRouter>;

type Post = RouterTypes['public']['post']['list']['output']['items'][number];
// Getting `items[number]` of `public.post.list.output`
