### Clear and concise description of the problem

As a develoepr using Vitest browser mode, I want to be able to search for elements within an iframe that is rendered by tested code.
If my code under test renders an iframe, I currently have no way of accessing elements within that iframe since the `page` object is scoped to the global iframe where the component under test is rendered and any iframe rendered within this will not have it's content visible to the `page` object.

