```

Notice the `ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE` for both constraints.

Now if I modify the `Category` entity to include the inverse side of the `ManyToMany` relation without adding any relation options, I would expect the same migration:

```ts
@Entity('categories')
export class Category {
    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn('uuid')
    id: string;

    @Column()
