【Important】The ts type prompt issue for EntityManager.increment and EntityManager.decrement！！

### What was unclear or otherwise insufficient?

Missing type hint for the second parameter (conditions) in the increase method. If I pass a number value. The generation of SQL is batch updated, and there may be a lack of where conditions, which is actually very dangerous. Actually, this happened to me. I suggest improving the type prompts for these two methods to avoid more injuries

