Fix select on deeply nested embedded entities, using Repository API

# Custom `FindOptionsSelect` options object (e.g. on `Repository.find`) selecting deeply nested embedded entities currently doesn't work

Given the `User` entity definition, having a deeply nested embedded entity (i.e. an [embedded entity](https://typeorm.io/embedded-entities) containing another embedded entitity):

```ts
import { Entity, PrimaryGeneratedColumn, Column } from "typeorm"

// In this case, `LatLong` is the deeply nested embedded entity, going through `Address`, within the `User` entity
export class LatLong {
    @Column()
    latitude: number;

    @Column()
    longitude: number;
}

export class Address {
    @Column(() => LatLong)
    latLong: LatLong;
}

@Entity()
export class User {

    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()
    id: number

    @Column()
    firstName: string

    @Column()
    lastName: string

    @Column(() => Address)
    address: Address;

    @Column()
    age: number

}
```

It is currently not possible to use the `select` / `FindOptionsSelect` object from the [Repository API](https://typeorm.io/repository-api)'s `find` method:

```ts
const usersWithLatitudeOnly = await AppDataSource.manager.find(User, {
        select: {
            id: true,
            address: {
                latLong: {
                    latitude: true
                }
            }
        }
    })
```

## Expected behaviour

TypeORM should be able to correctly perform the select query, picking only the `address.latLong.latitude` field. By using the [QueryBuilder API](https://typeorm.io/select-query-builder) this actually works:

```ts
const usersWithLatitudeOnly = await AppDataSource.createQueryBuilder(User, 'user')
        .select(['user.id', 'user.address.latLong.latitude'])
        .getMany();

console.log(require('util').inspect(usersWithLatitudeOnly, false, null, true));
```

The above statement prints:

```
[
  User {
    id: 1,
    address: Address { latLong: LatLong { latitude: -23.5506507 } }
  }
]
```

## Actual behaviour

Attempting to select a deeply nested embedded entity property currently throws the following error:

```
EntityPropertyNotFoundError: Property "latLong.latitude" was not found in "User". Make sure your query is correct.
    at SelectQueryBuilder.buildSelect ...
```

