### Additional Context
I believe I have identified how to fix the issue. Simply adding a second parameter `true` to all calls of `getEntityValue` in [`RelationLoader.ts`](https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/blob/master/src/query-builder/RelationLoader.ts). i.e. `getEntityValue(entity, true)` instead of `getEntityValue(entity)`.


